---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Pope Leo XIV — Our People — IICC Mission" description="His Holiness Pope Leo XIV — the Holy Father whose pontificate inspires the IICC Mission.">

  <div style="background:var(--color-off-white);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,39,81,0.07);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <a href="/our-people">Our People</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb__current">Pope Leo XIV</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-split" style="min-height:480px;">
    <div class="hero-split__text" style="background:var(--color-navy-dark);gap:1.25rem;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;">
        <img src="/IICC_Logo.png" alt="IICC Mission" style="height:3.5rem;object-fit:contain;" />
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-amber);font-weight:700;">Spiritual Leadership</span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.05;">
        <span style="display:block;color:var(--color-gold);font-size:clamp(0.875rem,1.5vw,1rem);letter-spacing:0.2em;margin-bottom:0.375rem;">HIS HOLINESS</span>
        <span style="display:block;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem);">POPE</span>
        <span style="display:block;color:var(--color-amber);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem);">LEO XIV</span>
      </h1>
      <span class="rule rule--amber"></span>
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.0625rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;">
        "Go out and make disciples of all nations." — Matthew 28:19
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-split__photo" style="min-height:320px;position:relative;">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757175-5700dde675bc?w=800&h=600&fit=crop" alt="Vatican City — St Peter's Basilica" />
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(18,26,56,0.88));padding:2rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-amber);letter-spacing:0.08em;">Vatican City, Rome</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px;">
      <div class="cols-2" style="gap:3rem;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The Holy Father</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">His Pontificate &amp; the IICC Mission</h2>
          <span class="rule rule--amber" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;"></span>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            His Holiness Pope Leo XIV continues the great tradition of the papacy in calling the Church to serve the poorest, the most marginalised and the most forgotten members of society. His teachings and example inspire IICC Mission in every dimension of our work.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            We are grateful for the Holy Father's spiritual leadership and his unwavering call to a Church that goes out to the peripheries — to prisons, detention centres, soup kitchens and anywhere that hope is most needed.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;">
            IICC Mission prays for His Holiness and for the entire Church as we carry the mission of Christ to those in the margins.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
          <div class="quote-box">
            <span class="quote-box__mark">"</span>
            <p class="quote-box__text">The Church exists to evangelise and to serve. We must not be a Church that only speaks, but a Church that acts — especially for the poor and the imprisoned.</p>
            <span class="quote-box__ref">— In the spirit of Pope Leo XIV's pontificate</span>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--color-navy-dark);border-radius:2px;padding:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
            <div style="width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-inline:auto;margin-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:#fff;">✝</div>
            <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.65;font-style:italic;">We pray for the Holy Father and for the universal Church in its mission to the margins of society.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
